setHubBridgeAdapter.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the relevant role
│  └── it should revert with AccessManagedUnauthorized
└── when caller has the relevant role
   ├── given an adapter address is already set for the provided bridge ID in caliber mailbox
   │  └── it should revert with HubBridgeAdapterAlreadySet
   └── given no adapter address is already set for the provided bridge ID in caliber mailbox
      ├── when the provided adapter address is zero
      │  └── it should revert with ZeroBridgeAdapterAddress
      └── when the provided adapter address is non-zero
         ├── it should set the adapter address in mailbox storage
         └── it should emit a HubBridgeAdapterSet event
